<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 50 0 R
/T (The operational architecture of this pipeline creates a strong defense compared to traditional, passive baseline models. While standard models evaluate inputs statically and rely on unmoving token identities, our robust framework applies an active defense strategy. During backpropagation, the loss function handles both clean and perturbed inputs simultaneously, which prevents the model's inner self-attention heads from relying on specific keyword variations. Instead, it forces the network to minimize local token dependency and distribute representation weights across the entire sentence context, establishing strong robustness against lexical drift. By tying the optimization loss to a wider distribution of word choices, the network learns to identify the emotional sentiment from the collective sentence structure rather than vulnerable keywords.)
/E (The operational architecture of this pipeline creates a strong defense compared to traditional, passive baseline models. While standard models evaluate inputs statically and rely on unmoving token identities, our robust framework applies an active defense strategy. During backpropagation, the loss function handles both clean and perturbed inputs simultaneously, which prevents the model's inner self-attention heads from relying on specific keyword variations. Instead, it forces the network to minimize local token dependency and distribute representation weights across the entire sentence context, establishing strong robustness against lexical drift. By tying the optimization loss to a wider distribution of word choices, the network learns to identify the emotional sentiment from the collective sentence structure rather than vulnerable keywords.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
91 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 50 0 R
/T (To showcase this functionality in real-world scenarios, the pipeline is fully connected to an active Gradio user interface that acts as a real-time deployment environment. Users can enter custom text strings into the application wrapper and select whether they want to route the input through the clean baseline setup or the newly fortified pipeline. The system then displays the final classification logs, highlighting how the self-attention adjustments protect the model's decisions from failing when keywords are switched. This interactive setup allows researchers to evaluate individual sentences on the fly, proving the practical value of our defensive fine-tuning framework in real-world environments.)
/E (To showcase this functionality in real-world scenarios, the pipeline is fully connected to an active Gradio user interface that acts as a real-time deployment environment. Users can enter custom text strings into the application wrapper and select whether they want to route the input through the clean baseline setup or the newly fortified pipeline. The system then displays the final classification logs, highlighting how the self-attention adjustments protect the model's decisions from failing when keywords are switched. This interactive setup allows researchers to evaluate individual sentences on the fly, proving the practical value of our defensive fine-tuning framework in real-world environments.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
